<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  {/* 页眉 A3 */}
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 80, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 36, background: '#FFC107' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据三层架构：事实 / 兼容 / 派生</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8F0', marginLeft: 18 }}>最关键的数据设计 · 不得互相替代</Text>
  </Box>
  {/* 内容区 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 580, flexDirection: 'row', padding: '20px 40px', gap: 26, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    {/* 左：SVG 三层架构图 */}
    <Box style={{ width: 660, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width={660} height={490} viewBox='0 0 660 490'>
        {/* 事实层 */}
        <rect x='10' y='10' width='640' height='120' rx='12' fill='#0E3F8C' />
        <text x='34' y='48' fontSize='24' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF'>事实层 · 分钟粒度</text>
        <text x='34' y='80' fontSize='16' fill='#C9D8F0'>bp_readings / bg_readings / med_logs　·　一次测量一条 · 纯追加永不覆盖</text>
        <text x='34' y='108' fontSize='16' fill='#C9D8F0'>「真实发生过什么」的唯一权威记录　·　作废只打 status = void</text>
        {/* 箭头 1 */}
        <path d='M330 138 L330 168' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='3' />
        <path d='M318 162 L330 176 L342 162 Z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
        <text x='348' y='162' fontSize='15' fill='#1E4FA8' fontWeight='bold'>确定性汇总</text>
        {/* 兼容层 */}
        <rect x='10' y='184' width='640' height='120' rx='12' fill='#1E4FA8' />
        <text x='34' y='222' fontSize='24' fontWeight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF'>兼容层 · 日粒度</text>
        <text x='34' y='254' fontSize='16' fill='#D8E4F6'>daily_health_records　·　一天一行 UPSERT</text>
        <text x='34' y='282' fontSize='16' fill='#D8E4F6'>血压取当日收缩压最大　·　血糖优先空腹、无则取当日最高</text>
        {/* 箭头 2 */}
        <path d='M330 312 L330 342' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='3' />
        <path d='M318 336 L330 350 L342 336 Z' fill='#3D7BD9' />
        <text x='348' y='336' fontSize='15' fill='#3D7BD9' fontWeight='bold'>实时派生</text>
        {/* 派生层 */}
        <rect x='10' y='358' width='640' height='120' rx='12' fill='#E8EFF8' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='34' y='396' fontSize='24' fontWeight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>派生层 · 实时计算（不落库）</text>
        <text x='34' y='428' fontSize='16' fill='#1A2230'>今日任务 / 评分 / 预警等级　·　buildDailyTasks() 派生</text>
        <text x='34' y='456' fontSize='16' fill='#1A2230'>进度由当日有效记录实时派生　·　每次读取重算</text>
      </svg>
    </Box>
    {/* 右：三角色说明 + NULL 警示卡 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '5px solid #0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>事实层</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>数据只描述「发生了什么」，是可追溯、不可篡改的底层事实</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>兼容层</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>为既有规则引擎提供「保守代表值」，口径确定性汇总</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '5px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>派生层</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则只回答「这意味着什么」，等级与任务随数据实时更新</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '2px solid #D9534F', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 18px', marginTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>Step 11 关键修复：NULL ≠ 0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
          NULL 是「未记录」，缺测该日不进规则序列。修复前缺测字段补 0，导致假预警、掩盖真预警、达标率虚高——三项同时出错。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>迈康 MyCare · 老年慢病多智能体协同健康管理平台</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06 / 15</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
